Package: com.huhansibuxin.powerlogprobe
Name: PowerlogProbe
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: PLAN C3 - standalone blacklist build for com.apple.aggregated. Ships in C3 mode with NO flag file needed: drops only pure diagnostic telemetry, allows every hardware/state Agent so per-App battery percentages stay accurate, and hooks only PLSQLiteConnection (PLCoreStorage rowids/completions/qualification/aggregates stay stock). Optional flags: MODE_C3_STRICT (PLAN B 33-prefix list), MODE_SQL_ONLY, MODE_WIDE, MODE_ORIGINAL, MODE_BLACKLIST, PASSTHROUGH_ALL/DISABLED. Logs to planC3.log.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
